\begin{itemize}
\item[S1] ULAM.AI and the UnsolvedMath Contributors, UnsolvedMath, record 30004866 (OWR-8415352-008). Catalogue curation under CC BY 4.0; definitions and English exposition added locally.
\url{https://huggingface.co/datasets/ulamai/UnsolvedMath}.
\item[S2] Geometry and Optimization in Quantum Information (2021), Oberwolfach Reports, DOI 10.4171/owr/2021/49, pp. 2665--2720. Original report and mathematical context.
\url{https://doi.org/10.4171/owr/2021/49}.
\end{itemize}
\label{end:30004866}

